---@class azure.machinelearningservices.AmlComputeProperties
---@field osType? azure.machinelearningservices.AmlComputePropertiesOsType Compute OS Type
---@field vmSize? string Virtual Machine Size
---@field vmPriority? azure.machinelearningservices.VmPriority Virtual Machine priority
---@field virtualMachineImage? azure.machinelearningservices.VirtualMachineImage|distilled.Null Virtual Machine image for AML Compute - windows only
