---@field stackMetaLearnerType? azure.machinelearningservices.StackEnsembleSettingsStackMetaLearnerType|string The meta-learner is a model trained on the output of the individual heterogeneous models.\r\nDefault meta-learners are LogisticRegression for classification tasks (or LogisticRegressionCV if cross-validation is enabled) and ElasticNet for regression/forecasting tasks (or ElasticNetCV if cross-validation is enabled).\r\nThis parameter can be one of the following strings: LogisticRegression, LogisticRegressionCV, LightGBMClassifier, ElasticNet, ElasticNetCV, LightGBMRegressor, or LinearRegression

